      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has a cardinality of 1176.\nPossible fields that we might be interested, depending on how much cardinality we want to reach:\n\n- status (card. 7, tot. 7)\n- site (card. 8, tot. 56)\n- rack group [our rows] (card. 14, tot. 784)\n- device role (card. 13, tot. 10192) [might overlap with manufacturer]\n- manufacturer (card. 21, tot. 214032)\n\nAll seems too much, so we could aggregate differently I guess, here is a multi-dimentional proposal with related grafana dashboards:\n\n- status (7), site (8), rack_group (14): 784\n  - dashboard parameters: site \u0026 row, show numbers per status\n  - dashboard parameters: site \u0026 status, show numbers per row\n- status(7), site(8), manufacturer (21): 1176\n  - dashboard parameters: site \u0026 manufacturer, show numbers per status\n  - dashboard parameters: site \u0026 status, show numbers per manufacturer\n- status (7) [pre-aggregated here, way cheaper than aggregating them later]\n- site (8) [pre-aggregated here, way cheaper than aggregating them later]\n- status (7), site (8): 56 [pre-aggregated here, way cheaper than aggregating them later]\n\ntotal: 2031 metrics\nTBD if doing all three aggregation or just one or two.",
